  "worked_solution": "To obtain the graph of $y=f(-x)$ from $y=f(x)$, we need to reflect the graph over the $y$-axis. The resulting graph is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14274786/assets/9a5f78a7458b4c09e30caf431e53153d541d72b65d533287384c09d30fbd430e.png)",
